<p>
  Kitchen remodel costs in Plano span a wide range, and the difference comes down to the level of finish and whether you change the layout. Here is a realistic look at what Plano homeowners can expect to invest.
</p>

<h2>Typical kitchen remodel ranges in Plano</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Custom kitchen remodel:</strong> roughly <strong>$40,000–$60,000</strong> for a complete remodel with custom cabinetry, quartz countertops, a tile backsplash, a quality appliance package, and updated lighting — with plumbing and electrical staying roughly in place.</li>
  <li><strong>Kitchen with layout changes:</strong> roughly <strong>$60,000–$85,000</strong> when you add wall removal, an island with seating, or a reworked work triangle.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium full-custom kitchens:</strong> <strong>$85,000–$100,000+</strong> with full custom cabinetry, premium stone like quartzite or marble, integrated appliances, and specialty features like butler pantries.</li>
</ul>

<h2>What drives the price up</h2>
<h3>Cabinetry is the centerpiece</h3>
<p>
  Custom cabinets are typically the largest line item — roughly 35–45% of the budget. Door style, wood species, finish, and hardware all move the number, and this is where a premium kitchen is really built.
</p>
<h3>Countertops and appliances</h3>
<p>
  Countertops and appliances each run roughly 12–18% of the budget. Quartz is the most popular choice for Plano kitchens; premium quartzite and marble sit at the top of the range. Pro-style ranges, panel-ready built-ins, and integrated refrigeration cost more but deliver the built-in look. See our <a href="/blog/quartz-vs-granite-countertops-plano-kitchens/">quartz vs. granite comparison</a> for help choosing.
</p>
<h3>Layout changes</h3>
<p>
  Removing walls, relocating plumbing, or adding an island with a sink and dishwasher adds cost — and permitting — but can completely transform how the kitchen functions.
</p>

<h2>The ranges hold across North Dallas</h2>
<p>
  These ranges generally hold across the North Dallas corridor, including <a href="/frisco-kitchen-bathroom-remodeling/">Frisco</a>, <a href="/allen-kitchen-bathroom-remodeling/">Allen</a>, and <a href="/mckinney-kitchen-bathroom-remodeling/">McKinney</a>. For neighborhood-by-neighborhood guidance, see our <a href="/plano-kitchen-remodeling/">Plano kitchen remodeling</a> page — East Plano galley kitchens and West Plano open plans can land at very different points in the same range.
</p>

<h2>Getting an accurate number</h2>
<p>
  Ranges are a useful starting point, but your actual estimate depends on your home and your goals. A <a href="/contact/">free consultation</a> gives you an itemized estimate for your specific kitchen, and our <a href="/cost-guides/">kitchen and bathroom cost guides</a> break down exactly what is included and what is not. Wondering how long the project will take? See our guide to <a href="/blog/how-long-does-a-kitchen-remodel-take-plano/">kitchen remodel timelines in Plano</a>.
</p>

